et. [[It]] [[has|have]] [[a]] [[blue]] [[door]].`,`vn`:`M\u1ed9t ng\u00e0y Ch\u1ee7 nh\u1eadt, b\u1ed1 v\u1ec1 nh\u00e0 v\u1edbi m\u1ed9t tin vui. \`B\u1ed1 t\u00ecm \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c nh\u00e0 cho c\u1ea3 nh\u00e0 r\u1ed3i. Nh\u00e0 c\u0169, nh\u01b0ng c\u00f3 v\u01b0\u1eddn!\` Ng\u00f4i nh\u00e0 \u1edf cu\u1ed1i ph\u1ed1 Hoa Sen. N\u00f3 c\u00f3 m\u1ed9t c\u00e1nh c\u1eeda m\u00e0u xanh.`},{`en`:`[[On]] [[the]] [[first]] [[day]], [[there]] [[are|be]] [[boxes|box]] [[in]] [[every]] [[room]]. Quang [[carries|carry]] [[boxes|box]] [[of]] [[cups|cup]], [[glasses|glass]] [[and]] [[bottles|bottle]]. Uyen [[carries|carry]] [[only]] [[one]] [[small]] [[box]]. \`[[What]] [[is|be]] [[in]] [[your]] [[box]]?\` [[asks|ask]] Quang. [[The]] [[box]] [[says|say]], \`Meow.\` [[It]] [[is|be]] [[her]] [[cat]], Miu.`,`vn`:`Ng\u00e0y \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean, ph\u00f2ng n\u00e0o c\u0169ng to\u00e0n th\u00f9ng c\u00e1c-t\u00f4ng. Quang b\u00ea nh\u1eefng th\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ef1ng t\u00e1ch, c\u1ed1c th\u1ee7y tinh v\u00e0 chai l\u1ecd. Uy\u00ean ch\u1ec9 \u00f4m m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc h\u1ed9p nh\u1ecf. \`Trong h\u1ed9p c\u1ee7a em c\u00f3 g\u00ec th\u1ebf?\` Quang h\u1ecfi. Chi\u1ebfc h\u1ed9p k\u00eau: \`Meo.\` L\u00e0 con m\u00e8o Miu c\u1ee7a b\u00e9.`},{`en`:`[[The]] [[house]] [[is|be]] [[big]] [[but]] [[very]] [[dirty]]. [[Mum]] [[cleans|clean]] [[the]] [[kitchen]] [[and]] [[the]] [[bathroom]]. [[The]] [[shower]] [[does|do]] [[not]] [[work]], [[and]] [[the]] [[toilet]] [[is|be]] [[green]]. [[There]] [[is|be]] an [[old]] [[bath]], [[and]] [[there]] [[is|be]] [[a]] [[mouse]] [[in]] [[it]]! Uyen [[shouts|shout]]. Miu [[is|be]] [[very]] [[interested]].`,`vn`:`Ng\u00f4i nh\u00e0 r\u1ed9ng nh\u01b0ng b\u1ea9n kinh kh\u1ee7ng. M\u1eb9 lau d\u1ecdn b\u1ebfp v\u00e0 ph\u00f2ng t\u1eafm. V\u00f2i hoa sen kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ea1y, c\u00f2n b\u1ed3n c\u1ea7u th\u00ec m\u00e0u xanh l\u00e8. C\u00f3 m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc b\u1ed3n t\u1eafm c\u0169, v\u00e0 trong b\u1ed3n c\u00f3 m\u1ed9t con chu\u1ed9t! 